// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P830175431" "You failed to rescue Sergeant Hastings and didn't learn what information he'd discovered."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2085952013" "Ah, don't kick yourself, {HeroName}, those PPD morons got in over their heads. There's only so much you could do to save someone from their own stupidity.<br><br>At least now we know about where the Resistance are down there, and they've probably been there for some time.<br><br>As for this critical information Hastings discovered, we'll just have to redouble our defenses and hope they're enough. I'm not gonna worry about it until the bullets start flying, so if you are, don't do it around me.<br><br>Hopefully this little tragedy will filter through the PPD ranks and remind them that it will be Powers Division, not the beat cops, who are gonna end this little resistance movement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1405910810" "You rescued Sergeant Hastings and the critical information he discovered."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2982676652" "Good job, {HeroName}. It sounds like Sergeant Hastings and his team discovered that the Resistance were planning a large coordinated attack on the Ministry of Information. Now that they know we know that, they'd be fools to try it.<br><br>Hrmm, first the Ministry of Technology, and now the Ministry of Information. I wonder what it is they're really after. The Resistance have shown that they have plans within plans and that what appears to be a full scale attack is actually just a diversion.<br><br>All in all it's not a bad day's work for the PPD. But hopefully this little adventure of theirs will filter through their ranks and remind them that it will be Powers Division, not the beat cops, who are gonna end this little resistance movement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P129090550" "Hello citizen! You are looking rather sharp today.<br><br>Perhaps I can interest you in some tulips or a nice floral arrangement for your domicile?<br><br>Everything in my selection is locally grown in the Neuron Technologies Unlimited synthetics facility; growing beauty smarter."
// Answer Text :
"P1780448484" "Ask about roses."
// Answer Text :
"P713750370" "Ask about synthetically grown flowers."
// Answer Text :
"P1349337055" "Tell it you want roses for Praetor White's lady."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Roses1 Text :
"P3774002405" "Of course, let me see what I have available...<br><br>Oh, I apologize, citizen, I appear to be all out of roses.<br><br>Could I interest you in another product?"
// Answer Text :
"P3675903972" "Ask about what else is in stock."
// Page Roses2 Text :
"P602156729" "Certainly, allow me to access my inventory...<br><br>Oh, I am terribly embarrassed, I appear to have nothing in stock at this time.<br><br>Could I interest you in another product?"
// Answer Text :
"P1449805973" "Ask who bought all the flowers."
// Answer Text :
"P3565245006" "What other product? You are all sold out!"
// Page Roses3a Text :
"P718446867" "I cannot give you the details on specific customers, citizen. However, I can tell you that there was quite a crowd of people here earlier and they purchased all of my inventory."
// Answer Text :
"P296012498" "Ask where they went."
// Page Roses3b Text :
"P2640850438" "Pardon me, citizen, allow me time to confirm your statement...<br><br>Ah yes, my inventory does appear to be empty.<br><br>Is there something else I can help you with?"
// Page Roses4 Text :
"P462593118" "Certainly, citizen. A number of citizens purchased and then took their flowers with them to honor the people killed in yesterday's terrorist attacks.<br><br>Can I be of further assistance?<br><br><color orange>It looks as if you are going to have to go find your own roses in the Magisterium Gardens. Open your mini-map (hotkey 'M') to see where you can find roses in the Magisterium Gardens. They will show up as starburst icons on the mini-map.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3381901524" "Thank and leave."
// Page Synthetic1 Text :
"P1266958833" "Certainly, citizen.<br><br>Neuron Technologies Unlimited is proud to provide the citizens of Praetoria City with the latest in their lineup of organo-synthetic products: Synth-Flora.<br><br>Synth-Flora products are superior to naturally grown flowers for a number of reasons: They smell better, have a more pleasing color, their lifespan is far superior to all naturally occurring species, and they are carefully screened for any sign of taint by devouring earth spores..."
// Answer Text :
"P2040225409" "Ask about Synth-Flora roses."
// Page Lady1 Text :
"P932268535" "Certainly, citizen.<br><br>While I check my inventory, just between you and I, Praetor White has been a repeat customer of late. I surmise that his purchase of roses for his lady are part of a human mating ritual. If that is the case, might I suggest some chocolates to accompany the roses?"
// Answer Text :
"P706637163" "Accept the chocolates."
// Answer Text :
"P3481260490" "Deny the chocolates."
// Page Lady2a Text :
"P3093677293" "Magnificent choice, citizen.<br><br>The combination of chocolates and roses has a 78% chance of a positive response. Much higher than just roses or chocolates alone.<br><br>Oh, I apologize, citizen, I appear to be all out of roses.<br><br>Could I interest you in another product?"
// Page Lady2b Text :
"P3842119095" "Are you certain, citizen?<br><br>The combination of chocolates and roses has a 78% chance of a positive response. Much higher than just roses or chocolates alone.<br><br>Oh, I apologize, citizen, I appear to be all out of roses.<br><br>Could I interest you in another product?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CleopatraDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3673077660" "Well, well, well, what have we here?"
// Answer Text :
"P3036879517" "Give Cleopatra the roses."
// Answer Text :
"P4114393730" "Give Cleopatra the roses and chocolates."
// Page RosesAndChocolatesPage1 Text :
"P2429474741" "For me? Oh! And chocolates!?<br><br>Thank you {Hero.gender=male suga'|sweetness}! But what are these even for?<br><br>Oh, wait a moment here, I get it... Michael put you up to this, didn't he?"
// Answer Text :
"P2776744361" "Yes he did."
// Answer Text :
"P1443073536" "No, actually, they're a gift from me. Who's Michael?"
// Page RosesPage1 Text :
"P2390737931" "For me?<br><br>Thanks {Hero.gender=male suga'|sweetness}, but what are these even for?<br><br>Oh, wait a moment here, I get it... Michael put you up to this, didn't he?"
// Page RosesPage2 Text :
"P3443179371" "Oh, if Michael thought he was sorry before... he is going to be <i>real</i> sorry when I have a word with him later. That man has got to learn that you have to say the words for it to count."
// Answer Text :
"P1803373397" "Did I do something wrong?"
// Page RosesPage3 Text :
"P3912992530" "Oh, not at all {Hero.gender=male honey|girlie}. It's not you I'm mad at.<br><br>Now get back to Mister <i>Alpha Dog</i> and you tell him that the roses were a fine gift. No sense in having him throw a tantrum at you on account of our personal business."
// Answer Text :
"P1121471670" "Will you be alright? I mean, he is Praetor White."
// Page RosesPage4 Text :
"P1145015727" "Oh, don't you worry about me. There's <i>two</i> people in this world can handle my man; Emperor Cole and myself.<br><br>See you around, {Hero.gender=male tiger|gorgeous}."
// Page LiePage1 Text :
"P2422688929" "Michael White, the Praetor. He's my boyfriend.<br><br>Anyhow, this is very sweet of you, {Hero.gender=male handsome|beautiful}, but frankly, I don't even know who you..."
// Answer Text :
"P2377697853" "The name's {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P3147907412" "I'm just kidding, Praetor White had me get them for you."
// Page FunnyPage1 Text :
"P3437341453" "Hmmm. Well, the joke wasn't bad, {Hero.gender=male honey|sweetness}, but if Michael thought he was sorry before... he is going to be <i>real</i> sorry when I have a word with him later. That man has got to learn that you have to say the words for it to count."
// Page LiePage2 Text :
"P2753503144" "...Well alright then, {HeroName}. It's a pleasure to meet you, and thank you for the gift, but I don't think Michael will appreciate you bringing me gifts, though I am flattered."
// Answer Text :
"P1156967558" "Michael doesn't have to know..."
// Page LiePage3 Text :
"P3018622223" "...<br><br>You don't seem to be getting the message, {HeroName}, so let me break it down to you, real simple.<br><br>Michael and I are together, and he will find out that one of his little pups brought me a gift, because <i>I'm</i> going to tell him. So you may want to rethink just exactly what it is you are doing here."
// Answer Text :
"P485862501" "Actually, Michael sent me to get those for you, I've been having fun with you."
// Page LiePage4 Text :
"P2639629172" "Oh...<br><br>Oh, now that's funny. Wow {Hero.gender=male baby|girl}, you really had me going there for a minute. I was like, <i>this {Hero.gender=male boy|girl} cannot be this stupid</i>...<br><br>Well, you can tell Michael thank you for the gift."
// Answer Text :
"P2141117208" "Leave."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P979915548" "Well, things seem to have calmed down a bit. At least, enough for me to feel comfortable sending you out for an errand while I keep my eye on things.<br><br>It ain't flashy but I need it done. Think of it as a personal favor for yours truly.<br><br><color orange>I need you to get me some flowers for my lady</color>. Can I count on you?"
// AcceptString :
"P832947635" "Flowers? I didn't sign up for this."
// SendOffString :
"P2553875023" "I didn't sign up for this either...<br><br>...<br><br>Listen, {HeroName}, when Cleo's unhappy, I'm unhappy, and nobody wants me unhappy, alright?<br><br>Now, <color orange>head over to the flower vendor near the transit station</color> and pick up some synthetic yellow roses. Cleo likes them best."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4024848513" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Just as Sweet</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1772694439" "Talk to the Flower Vendor"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3983065593" "It's a simple task, {HeroName}. Stop whining and get the roses for my lady, alright?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4200438811" "You've talked to the flower vendor but it's all out of roses. The Magisterium gardens, however, do grow roses. Nobody would notice if a few went missing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
