// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P423028493" "Deliver roses to Cleopatra"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P150360227" "Don't bring the roses to me, fool. <color orange>Take them to my lady.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2747485243" "You delivered the roses to Cleopatra. Report back to Praetor White for further instructions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2532147834" "Did she like them?<br><br>Alright... Good. Dodged that bullet.<br><br>You know what, {HeroName}, you ain't half bad."
// RandomFameString :
"P2426844386" "I hear Praetor White pissed off his old lady again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DuvalDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1891125044" "How can I help you?"
// Answer Text :
"P1609614533" "I'm here to conduct Praetor White's inspection of this lab."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P4097535343" "I see, how very unexpected.<br><br>Well, as you can see, we're inspecting the labs right now. So, there is no need for you to be here."
// Answer Text :
"P3097982155" "I'm under strict orders, Captain."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2053005791" "I see. That is unfortunate for you then."
// Answer Text :
"P1429902890" "You mean to push on the issue?"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2426945616" "Not push, shove!"
// Answer Text :
"P1850903540" "-Really-?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2853666415" "You may think that my job is pretty cushy, huh {HeroName}?<br><br>Well it isn't all flexing for cameras and sippin' mimosas with the lady, let me tell ya. Sometimes, being in charge, you have to deal with some real steaming piles of red tape.<br><br>And now is one of those times. <color orange>I want you to head down to Gravatech labs</color>. I've got a job down there that needs your attention for detail. Can I count on you?"
// AcceptString :
"P140168084" "Inspect Gravatech Labs"
// SendOffString :
"P1782761884" "Listen, it's nothing fancy, just a routine inspection of the labs. The thing is, I got wind that a PPD squad went in there to inspect the labs, led by Captain Duval from Precinct 5.<br><br>The PPD aren't scheduled to inspect the place for a few weeks, which makes me suspicious. Duval could just be trying to flex his muscle a little to show that he can still handle the job, but it could be something else.<br><br>Everyone sees me from a mile off, someone always snitches that the big dog is coming, so this time, <color orange>I'm sending you to do the inspection for me.</color> Might help to have someone who isn't smashin' the front door down, you know?<br><br><color orange>Just be careful. Some of the PPD guys don't like that my Powers Division boys are better than them and they might see you as walking in on their jurisdiction.</color> Show 'em your teeth and they'll back down, just try not to hurt any of 'em too badly, we're supposed to be working together afterall."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1326179822" "Don't make the same mistake I did when bearing your teeth. I once bit a guy that got too close. True story."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1482181986" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: On Whose Authority</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P229159048" "It would appear that your surprise inspection has caught everyone off guard."

